### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8008

### Registrar nuevo Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admins/c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "nombre": "Andrea",
  "primer_apellido": "Torres",
  "segundo_apellido": "Vasquez",
  "documento": "11223344",
  "password": "admin_password_seguro"
}

### Registrar segundo Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admins/d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-defa-234567890123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_admin}}

{
  "nombre": "Luis",
